  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Season cod fillets with salt, allspice, and smoked paprika.",
    "Bake cod fillets in the oven for 12 minutes or until cooked through.",
    "In a large skillet, heat 2 tablespoons of oil over medium heat.",
    "Add chopped onion and scotch bonnet peppers to the skillet and saute for 5 minutes.",
    "Add diced Korean pear to the skillet and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "In a large bowl, combine cooked brown rice, rest meat, and the skillet mixture.",
    "Top the bowl with baked cod fillets and garnish with fresh thyme.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
